msgid "Concurrent State Without Allocation"
msgstr "无分配的并发状态"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:380
msgid ""
"Analyse the shard locks, the Robin Hood spent set, the GCRA limiter, the "
"versioned ban table, the MPSC incident ring, and the read-copy-update "
"publication of the policy engine with ``Arc`` and a generation-checked "
"cache."
msgstr ""
"分析分片锁、Robin Hood 已用集合、GCRA 限制器、带版本号的封禁表、MPSC 事件环，以及借助 ``Arc`` "
