#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:410
msgid ""
"An edge server runs more connection threads than CPUs, and a spin lock "
"whose holder is preempted makes every waiter burn its time slice, so we "
"keep the mutex. A poisoned lock is entered rather than propagated: no "
"operation panics while it holds a shard, and the shard stays structurally "
"valid even if one did."
msgstr ""
"边缘服务器运行的连接线程多于 CPU "
"数，而持有者被抢占的自旋锁会让每个等待者白白耗尽自己的时间片，因此我们保留互斥锁。中毒的锁会被直接进入，而不是传播错误：没有任何操作会在持有分片时 "
"panic，即使发生了，分片在结构上也仍然有效。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:412
msgid "The Robin Hood Spent Set"
msgstr "Robin Hood 已用集合"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:415
msgid ""
"Only accepted proofs enter the spent set (Part III). It has 16 shards, "
"each an open-addressed array of 4,096 slots of ``Option<Entry>``, where "
"an entry is ``{ tag: [u8; 16], expires_at: u64, dist: u8 }``. Robin Hood "
"insertion (Celis, 1986) displaces any occupant closer to its home than "
"the incoming key, which keeps probe lengths tightly clustered; lookups "
"stop as soon as they meet an entry nearer its home than they are to "
"theirs."
msgstr ""
"只有被接受的证明才会进入已用集合（第 III 部分）。它有 16 个分片，每个分片是一个开放寻址数组，包含 4,096 个 "
"``Option<Entry>`` 槽，其中条目为 ``{ tag: [u8; 16], expires_at: u64, dist: u8 "
"}``。Robin Hood "
"插入（Celis，1986）会挤走任何比新来的键更靠近自己初始位置的占用者，从而使探测长度紧密集中；查找一旦遇到一个比自己更靠近其初始位置的条目，就会停止。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:417
msgid "Implementation: ``Table::insert``"
msgstr "实现：``Table::insert``"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:419
msgid ""
"Inserts a spent tag with its expiry, reclaiming expired slots on the way. "
"In ``crates/store/src/spent.rs`` (crate ``sibuna-store``)."
msgstr ""
"插入一个带过期时间的已用标签，并在途中回收过期的槽。位于 ``crates/store/src/spent.rs``\\ （crate "
"``sibuna-store``）。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:421
msgid ""
"fn insert(\n"
"    &mut self,\n"
"    tag: &Tag,\n"
"    expires_at: u64,\n"
"    now: u64,\n"
") -> Result<(), SpendError> {\n"
"    if !self.can_insert(tag, now) {\n"
"        return Err(SpendError::Full);\n"
"    }\n"
"    let mut carry = Entry { tag: *tag, expires_at, dist: 0 };\n"
"    let mut idx = Self::home(tag);\n"
"    while carry.dist < MAX_PROBE {\n"
"        let slot = &mut self.entries[idx];\n"
"        let Some(e) = slot else {\n"
"            *slot = Some(carry);\n"
"            return Ok(());\n"
"        };\n"
"        // Overwriting an expired occupant is safe only when the new "
"distance\n"
"        // is not smaller, so keys probing past this slot still pass the\n"
"        // early-termination test.\n"
"        if e.is_expired(now) && carry.dist >= e.dist {\n"
"            *e = carry;\n"
"            return Ok(());\n"
"        }\n"
"        if carry.dist > e.dist {\n"
"            std::mem::swap(&mut carry, e);\n"
"            // A displaced expired entry is simply dropped.\n"
"            if carry.is_expired(now) {\n"
"                return Ok(());\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"        idx = (idx + 1) % SHARD_CAPACITY;\n"
"        carry.dist += 1;\n"
"    }\n"
"    Err(SpendError::Full)\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn insert(\n"
"    &mut self,\n"
"    tag: &Tag,\n"
"    expires_at: u64,\n"
"    now: u64,\n"
") -> Result<(), SpendError> {\n"
"    if !self.can_insert(tag, now) {\n"
"        return Err(SpendError::Full);\n"
"    }\n"
"    let mut carry = Entry { tag: *tag, expires_at, dist: 0 };\n"
"    let mut idx = Self::home(tag);\n"
"    while carry.dist < MAX_PROBE {\n"
"        let slot = &mut self.entries[idx];\n"
"        let Some(e) = slot else {\n"
"            *slot = Some(carry);\n"
"            return Ok(());\n"
"        };\n"
"        // 只有当新的探测距离不更小时，覆盖已过期的占用者才是安全的，\n"
"        // 这样，探测越过此槽的键仍能通过\n"
"        // 提前终止检查。\n"
"        if e.is_expired(now) && carry.dist >= e.dist {\n"
"            *e = carry;\n"
"            return Ok(());\n"
"        }\n"
"        if carry.dist > e.dist {\n"
"            std::mem::swap(&mut carry, e);\n"
"            // 被挤出的过期条目直接丢弃。\n"
"            if carry.is_expired(now) {\n"
"                return Ok(());\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"        idx = (idx + 1) % SHARD_CAPACITY;\n"
"        carry.dist += 1;\n"
"    }\n"
"    Err(SpendError::Full)\n"
"}"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:460
msgid ""
"The expired-slot rule is the subtle part: an expired entry may be "
"overwritten in place only by a key at least as far from its home, "
"otherwise a later key that probes past the slot would stop early and be "
"lost. Expired entries that get displaced are simply dropped. No sweeper "
"thread is needed. Insertion first simulates the displacement path without "
"changing anything (``can_insert``) and checks that bounded displacement "
"can succeed without losing a live tag."
msgstr ""
"过期槽的规则是其中微妙的部分：只有距离自己初始位置至少同样远的键，才能原地覆盖一个过期条目，否则一个探测会越过该槽的后来键将提前停止并丢失。被挤走的过期条目直接丢弃。不需要清扫线程。插入时先在不改变任何内容的情况下模拟挤占路径（``can_insert``），确认有界的挤占可以成功且不会丢失任何存活的标签。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:462 ../../zero-allocation.rst:682
msgid "Invariant"
msgstr "不变量"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:464
msgid ""
"A refused insertion never evicts a live tag. A tag that was spent and has "
"not expired is therefore always found, and the refusal "
"(``SpendError::Full``) can deny service but never enable a replay."
msgstr ""
"被拒绝的插入永远不会逐出存活的标签。因此，一个已被使用且尚未过期的标签总能被找到，而拒绝（``SpendError::Full``）可能导致拒绝服务，但永远不会让重放成为可能。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:466
msgid ""
"A slot is ``Option<Entry>``. An empty slot has no tag to read, so there "
"is no ``occupied`` flag that a reader could forget to check, and "
"``match`` will not compile until both cases are handled. The error type "
"is equally exact: the spent set can fail in two ways (``DoubleSpend`` and "
"``Full``), and ``SpendError`` names exactly those."
msgstr ""
"一个槽是 ``Option<Entry>``。空槽中没有可读的标签，因此不存在读者可能忘记检查的 ``occupied`` "
"标志，而且在两种情况都被处理之前，``match`` 无法通过编译。错误类型同样精确：已用集合有两种失败方式（``DoubleSpend`` 和 "
"``Full``），``SpendError`` 恰好列出这两种。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:468
msgid "GCRA: Rate Limiting in One Integer"
msgstr "GCRA：用一个整数实现速率限制"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:471
msgid ""
"The Generic Cell Rate Algorithm (ATM Forum, 1996) is the "
"virtual-scheduling form of the leaky bucket. Per client it stores one "
"*theoretical arrival time* (TAT). With emission interval :math:`T = "
"\\max(1, \\lceil W / N \\rceil)` for a positive limit :math:`N` per "
"window :math:`W`, and burst tolerance :math:`\\tau = (N - 1) T`:"
msgstr ""
"通用信元速率算法（ATM Forum，1996）是漏桶算法的虚拟调度形式。它为每个客户端保存一个 *理论到达时间*\\ （TAT）。对于每个窗口 "
":math:`W` 内的正限额 :math:`N`，发射间隔为 :math:`T = \\max(1, \\lceil W / N "
"\\rceil)`，突发容限为 :math:`\\tau = (N - 1) T`："

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:473
msgid ""
"\\text{arrival at } t \\text{ conforms} \\iff \\mathrm{TAT} \\le t + "
"\\tau, \\quad \\text{then } \\mathrm{TAT} \\leftarrow "
"\\max(\\mathrm{TAT}, t) + T."
msgstr ""
"\\text{arrival at } t \\text{ conforms} \\iff \\mathrm{TAT} \\le t + "
"\\tau, \\quad \\text{then } \\mathrm{TAT} \\leftarrow "
"\\max(\\mathrm{TAT}, t) + T."

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:477
msgid "Theorem (token-bucket bound)"
msgstr "定理（令牌桶上界）"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:479
msgid ""
"After the first conforming arrival at :math:`t_1`, the :math:`k`-th "
"conforming arrival satisfies :math:`t_k - t_1 \\ge (k - 1) T - \\tau`. "
"Hence any interval of length :math:`L` contains at most :math:`N + "
"\\lfloor L / T \\rfloor` conforming arrivals: a burst of :math:`N`, then "
"one per :math:`T`. There is no fixed-window boundary artefact beyond the "
"defined burst, and no per-request history."
msgstr ""
"在 :math:`t_1` 处的第一次合规到达之后，第 :math:`k` 次合规到达满足 :math:`t_k - t_1 \\ge (k - "
"1) T - \\tau`。因此，任何长度为 :math:`L` 的时间段内至多有 :math:`N + \\lfloor L / T "
"\\rfloor` 次合规到达：先是 :math:`N` 次突发，然后每个 :math:`T` "
"一次。除了定义的突发之外，不存在固定窗口边界造成的异常，也不需要保存每个请求的历史。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:481
msgid ""
"A chart of TAT against arrival time for T = 200 ms and tau = 800 ms. Five "
"arrivals at t = 0 are admitted while TAT rises from 0 to 1000 ms; a sixth "
"at t = 0 finds 1000 ms above the line t + tau and is refused. Afterwards "
"an arrival halfway between multiples of 200 ms is refused, and one at "
"each multiple of 200 ms finds TAT exactly on the line and is admitted."
msgstr ""
"T = 200 ms、tau = 800 ms 时 TAT 随到达时间变化的图。t = 0 时的五次到达被准入，TAT "
"从 0 升至 1000 ms；t = 0 时的第六次到达发现 TAT 为 1000 ms，高于直线 t + tau，"
"因而被拒绝。此后，位于两个 200 ms 整数倍正中间的到达被拒绝，而恰好位于 200 ms 整数倍处的到达发现 "
"TAT 正好落在直线上，因而被准入。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:484
msgid ""
"GCRA admission for a limit of 5 per second: a burst of five, then one "
"every 200 ms. An arrival is admitted when the TAT it finds lies on or "
"below the line :math:`t + \\tau`."
msgstr ""
"限额为每秒 5 次时的 GCRA 准入：先是五次突发，然后每 200 ms 一次。到达时若 TAT 位于直线 "
":math:`t + \\tau` 上或其下方，就会被准入。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:486
msgid "Worked example: five per second by hand"
msgstr "实例分析：手工计算每秒五次"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:488
msgid ""
"Take :math:`N = 5` and :math:`W = 1000` ms, so :math:`T = 200` ms and "
":math:`\\tau = 800` ms, and let a client that has been idle send six "
"requests at :math:`t = 0`. The first finds an empty cell: "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT} = \\max(0, 0) = 0 \\le 800`, so it conforms and "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT} \\leftarrow 200`. The next four conform the same way "
"and leave :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} = 1000`. The sixth finds :math:`1000 > 0 + "
"800` and is refused with ``Retry-After`` :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} - \\tau - t "
"= 200` ms. At :math:`t = 199` a request still finds :math:`1000 > 999` "
"and is refused; at :math:`t = 200` it finds :math:`1000 \\le 1000`, "
"conforms, and leaves :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} = 1200`. The unit test "
"``gcra_admits_exactly_the_burst_then_drains_at_the_emission_rate`` in "
"``crates/store/src/limiter.rs`` checks exactly these numbers."
msgstr ""
"取 :math:`N = 5`，:math:`W = 1000` ms，于是 :math:`T = 200` ms，:math:`\\tau = "
"800` ms；让一个一直空闲的客户端在 :math:`t = 0` "
"时发送六个请求。第一个请求遇到一个空单元：:math:`\\mathrm{TAT} = \\max(0, 0) = 0 \\le "
"800`，因此它合规，并且 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} \\leftarrow 200`。接下来的四个请求以同样方式合规，使 "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT} = 1000`。第六个请求发现 :math:`1000 > 0 + "
"800`，被拒绝，``Retry-After`` 为 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} - \\tau - t = 200` ms。在 "
":math:`t = 199` 时，请求仍然发现 :math:`1000 > 999`，被拒绝；在 :math:`t = 200` 时，它发现 "
":math:`1000 \\le 1000`，合规，并使 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} = "
"1200`。``crates/store/src/limiter.rs`` 中的单元测试 "
"``gcra_admits_exactly_the_burst_then_drains_at_the_emission_rate`` "
"正是检查这些数字。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:490
msgid "Implementation: ``arrive``"
msgstr "实现：``arrive``"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:492
msgid ""
"Applies one arrival to the cells of a locked shard and returns the "
"decision, the retry delay and the remaining budget. In "
"``crates/store/src/limiter.rs`` (crate ``sibuna-store``)."
msgstr ""
"把一次到达应用到已加锁分片的单元上，并返回决定、重试延迟和剩余预算。位于 ``crates/store/src/limiter.rs``\\ "
"（crate ``sibuna-store``）。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:494
msgid ""
"fn arrive(\n"
"    cells: &mut [Cell; SLOTS_PER_SHARD],\n"
"    key: u64,\n"
"    now_ms: u64,\n"
"    limits: Limits,\n"
") -> Decision {\n"
"    let interval = limits.emission_interval();\n"
"    let tau = limits.burst_tolerance();\n"
"    let Some(cell) = locate(cells, key, now_ms, tau) else {\n"
"        return Decision {\n"
"            limited: true,\n"
"            capacity_exhausted: true,\n"
"            retry_after_ms: interval,\n"
"            remaining: 0,\n"
"        };\n"
"    };\n"
"    let tat = cell.tat_ms.max(now_ms);\n"
"    let horizon = now_ms.saturating_add(tau);\n"
"    if tat > horizon {\n"
"        return Decision {\n"
"            limited: true,\n"
"            capacity_exhausted: false,\n"
"            retry_after_ms: tat - tau - now_ms,\n"
"            remaining: 0,\n"
"        };\n"
"    }\n"
"    cell.tat_ms = tat.saturating_add(interval);\n"
"    // ... remaining = min(rate, floor((t + tau - TAT) / T) + 1)\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn arrive(\n"
"    cells: &mut [Cell; SLOTS_PER_SHARD],\n"
"    key: u64,\n"
"    now_ms: u64,\n"
"    limits: Limits,\n"
") -> Decision {\n"
"    let interval = limits.emission_interval();\n"
"    let tau = limits.burst_tolerance();\n"
"    let Some(cell) = locate(cells, key, now_ms, tau) else {\n"
"        return Decision {\n"
"            limited: true,\n"
"            capacity_exhausted: true,\n"
"            retry_after_ms: interval,\n"
"            remaining: 0,\n"
"        };\n"
"    };\n"
"    let tat = cell.tat_ms.max(now_ms);\n"
"    let horizon = now_ms.saturating_add(tau);\n"
"    if tat > horizon {\n"
"        return Decision {\n"
"            limited: true,\n"
"            capacity_exhausted: false,\n"
"            retry_after_ms: tat - tau - now_ms,\n"
"            remaining: 0,\n"
"        };\n"
"    }\n"
"    cell.tat_ms = tat.saturating_add(interval);\n"
"    // ... remaining = min(rate, floor((t + tau - TAT) / T) + 1)\n"
"}"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:526
msgid ""
"The shard's ``check`` takes the lock and calls ``arrive`` with the locked "
"cells; the guard releases the lock when ``check`` returns. Cells are 16 "
"bytes (a key and a TAT) in 16 shards of 512 slots with a 16-slot probe "
"window, about 128 KiB in all. A cell whose TAT is older than :math:`t - "
"\\tau` has drained and is reclaimed on the spot. The ``Retry-After`` "
"header is computed from the same arithmetic. Saturated probe windows "
"refuse new clients rather than evicting active quota state, and the "
"decision says so (``capacity_exhausted``), so a caller does not escalate "
"a saturation refusal into a ban. A zero configured rate refuses requests. "
"One limiter serves several rules: the cell key is a Wyhash of the client "
"address seeded with the rule's scope, so the same client in different "
"scopes has independent budgets."
msgstr ""
"分片的 ``check`` 获取锁，并用已加锁的单元调用 ``arrive``；``check`` 返回时，守卫释放锁。单元为 16 "
"字节（一个键和一个 TAT），分布在 16 个分片中，每个分片 512 个槽，探测窗口为 16 个槽，总计约 128 KiB。TAT 早于 "
":math:`t - \\tau` 的单元已经排空，会被当场回收。``Retry-After`` "
"响应头由同样的算术计算得出。探测窗口饱和时，会拒绝新客户端，而不是逐出活跃的配额状态，并且决定中会注明这一点（``capacity_exhausted``），使调用方不会把饱和造成的拒绝升级为封禁。配置的速率为零时拒绝请求。一个限制器可服务多条规则：单元的键是以规则作用域为种子、对客户端地址计算的 "
"Wyhash，因此同一个客户端在不同作用域中拥有相互独立的预算。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:528
msgid "The Versioned Ban Table"
msgstr "带版本号的封禁表"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:531
msgid ""
"Bans use 4,096 slots with atomic version, key and expiry fields, "
"open-addressed by a keyed hash of the banned address with an 8-slot probe "
"window. A writer, serialised with the other writers by a mutex, brackets "
"each update with version increments; readers take no lock, accept only a "
"stable even version, and retry concurrent changes."
msgstr ""
"封禁使用 4,096 个槽，每个槽具有原子的版本、键和过期时间字段，按被封禁地址的带密钥哈希进行开放寻址，探测窗口为 8 "
"个槽。写者通过互斥锁与其他写者串行执行，并在每次更新前后各递增一次版本号；读者不加锁，只接受稳定的偶数版本号，遇到并发修改时重试。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:533
msgid "Implementation: ``BanTable::ban`` and ``BanTable::read_slot``"
msgstr "实现：``BanTable::ban`` 和 ``BanTable::read_slot``"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:535
msgid ""
"The writer's bracket and the reader's consistent snapshot. In "
"``crates/store/src/ban_table.rs`` (crate ``sibuna-store``)."
msgstr ""
"写者的前后递增，以及读者获得的一致快照。位于 ``crates/store/src/ban_table.rs``\\ （crate "
"``sibuna-store``）。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:537
msgid ""
"pub fn ban(&self, banned: &[u8], until: u64, now: u64) {\n"
"    let key = slot_key(banned);\n"
"    let _writers = self.lock_writers();\n"
"    let victim = &self.slots[self.victim(key, now)];\n"
"    // A key and an expiry are one logical value: bracket the replacement "
"with\n"
"    // an odd version so readers cannot combine an old key with the next "
"key's\n"
"    // expiry.\n"
"    victim.version.fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"    victim.until.store(until, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"    victim.key.store(key, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"    victim.version.fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn read_slot(&self, slot: &Slot) -> (u64, u64) {\n"
"    loop {\n"
"        let before = slot.version.load(Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"        if before & 1 != 0 {\n"
"            std::hint::spin_loop();\n"
"            continue;\n"
"        }\n"
"        let key = slot.key.load(Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"        let until = slot.until.load(Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"        if before == slot.version.load(Ordering::SeqCst) {\n"
"            return (key, until);\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"pub fn ban(&self, banned: &[u8], until: u64, now: u64) {\n"
"    let key = slot_key(banned);\n"
"    let _writers = self.lock_writers();\n"
"    let victim = &self.slots[self.victim(key, now)];\n"
"    // 键和过期时间是一个逻辑值：替换期间让版本号保持为奇数，\n"
"    // 使读者无法把旧键与下一个键的过期时间\n"
"    // 拼在一起。\n"
"    victim.version.fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"    victim.until.store(until, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"    victim.key.store(key, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"    victim.version.fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn read_slot(&self, slot: &Slot) -> (u64, u64) {\n"
"    loop {\n"
"        let before = slot.version.load(Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"        if before & 1 != 0 {\n"
"            std::hint::spin_loop();\n"
"            continue;\n"
"        }\n"
"        let key = slot.key.load(Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"        let until = slot.until.load(Ordering::SeqCst);\n"
"        if before == slot.version.load(Ordering::SeqCst) {\n"
"            return (key, until);\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:567
msgid ""
"Sequential consistency prevents mixing an old identity with a replacement "
"expiry: every access belongs to one total order, which keeps the argument "
"simple. Readers take no mutex, but can wait for a writer and are not "
"wait-free. These atomic operations have real cost, measured indirectly in "
"the HTTP harness rather than assumed free. A full probe window overwrites "
"a slot that has expired, or else the slot that expires first. ``clear`` "
"lifts every ban but leaves the keys in place, because an emptied slot "
"could hide a colliding key later in a probe chain."
msgstr ""
"顺序一致性防止把旧的身份与替换后的过期时间混在一起：每次访问都属于同一个全序，这使论证保持简单。读者不使用互斥锁，但可能需要等待写者，因此不是无等待的。这些原子操作有实际的成本，这一成本在 "
"HTTP 测量工具中间接测得，而不是假定为零。探测窗口已满时，覆盖一个已过期的槽，否则覆盖最先过期的槽。``clear`` "
"解除所有封禁，但保留键不动，因为一个被清空的槽可能会让探测链中后面一个发生碰撞的键无法被找到。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:569
msgid "The MPSC Incident Ring"
msgstr "MPSC 事件环"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:572
msgid ""
"When the Shield surface denies a request or the honeypot fires, the "
"incident is copied into a fixed record of about 1.3 KB (client address, "
"User-Agent, method, path, category and payload, each cut at its capacity) "
"and pushed onto a bounded multi-producer single-consumer ring (Vyukov's "
"sequence-stamped design, 512 slots, ``BoundedQueue<IncidentRecord, "
"512>``). Producers are connection threads; the consumer is the storage "
"thread. A full ring drops the newest record rather than blocking a "
"response, an explicit loss policy rather than a durability guarantee. The "
"drop counter makes that loss observable."
msgstr ""
"当 Shield 形态拒绝一个请求或蜜罐被触发时，事件被复制进一条约 1.3 KB "
"的固定记录（客户端地址、User-Agent、方法、路径、类别和载荷，各自按容量截断），并推入一个有界的多生产者单消费者环（Vyukov "
"的带序号设计，512 个槽，``BoundedQueue<IncidentRecord, "
"512>``）。生产者是连接线程；消费者是存储线程。环满时丢弃最新的记录，而不是阻塞响应，这是一种明确的丢失策略，而不是持久性保证。丢弃计数器使这种丢失可以被观察到。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:574
msgid ""
"/// Copies `incident` into the ring; a full ring drops it and counts the "
"drop.\n"
"pub(crate) fn record(&self, incident: &Incident<'_>) {\n"
"    if self.queue.push(IncidentRecord::from_incident(incident)).is_err() "
"{\n"
"        self.metrics.incidents_dropped.bump();\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"/// 把 `incident` 复制进环形缓冲区；缓冲区已满时丢弃它，并为丢弃计数。\n"
"pub(crate) fn record(&self, incident: &Incident<'_>) {\n"
"    if self.queue.push(IncidentRecord::from_incident(incident)).is_err() "
"{\n"
"        self.metrics.incidents_dropped.bump();\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:583
msgid ""
"After moving a record into a pending batch, the storage thread retains "
"it, together with the prepared rows, until the commit is confirmed; it "
"does not silently discard it on a database error, and a retry writes the "
"identical batch."
msgstr ""
"把一条记录移入待处理批次之后，存储线程会连同准备好的行一起保留它，直到提交得到确认；遇到数据库错误时，它不会悄悄丢弃这条记录，重试时写入的是完全相同的批次。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:585
msgid ""
"Each slot carries a sequence number that tells producers whether the slot "
"is free and the consumer whether it is full, so neither side takes a "
"lock. A ring like this cannot be written in safe Rust: producers and the "
"consumer touch different slots of one array at the same time, and only "
"the sequence protocol, not the type system, proves which thread may touch "
"which slot. The module ``crates/store/src/ring.rs`` therefore holds its "
"values in ``UnsafeCell<MaybeUninit<T>>`` slots, and each ``unsafe`` block "
"names the step of the protocol that justifies it:"
msgstr ""
"每个槽带有一个序号，它告诉生产者该槽是否空闲，告诉消费者该槽是否已满，因此双方都不需要加锁。这样的环无法用安全的 Rust "
"编写：生产者和消费者同时访问同一个数组的不同槽，而证明哪个线程可以访问哪个槽的，只有序号协议，而不是类型系统。因此，模块 "
"``crates/store/src/ring.rs`` 把值存放在 ``UnsafeCell<MaybeUninit<T>>`` 槽中，每个 "
"``unsafe`` 块都写明了为其提供依据的协议步骤："

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:587
msgid ""
"if diff == 0 {\n"
"    // Relaxed: the CAS only arbitrates which producer owns position "
"`pos`.\n"
"    match self.tail.0.compare_exchange_weak(\n"
"        pos, pos.wrapping_add(1), Ordering::Relaxed, Ordering::Relaxed,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"        Ok(_) => {\n"
"            // SAFETY: the CAS gave this thread position `pos`, and\n"
"            // `sequence == pos` says the slot is empty; no other "
"producer can\n"
"            // claim `pos` and the consumer does not read it before the "
"Release\n"
"            // store below.\n"
"            unsafe { (*slot.value.get()).write(value) };\n"
"            // Release: publishes the written value to the consumer.\n"
"            slot.sequence.store(pos.wrapping_add(1), Ordering::Release);\n"
"            return Ok(());\n"
"        }\n"
"        Err(current) => pos = current,\n"
"    }\n"
"} else if diff < 0 {\n"
"    return Err(value);\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"if diff == 0 {\n"
"    // Relaxed：CAS 只裁定哪个生产者拥有位置 `pos`。\n"
"    match self.tail.0.compare_exchange_weak(\n"
"        pos, pos.wrapping_add(1), Ordering::Relaxed, Ordering::Relaxed,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"        Ok(_) => {\n"
"            // SAFETY: CAS 把位置 `pos` 分给了本线程，\n"
"            // 而 `sequence == pos` 表明该槽为空；其他生产者无法\n"
"            // 占用 `pos`，消费者在下面的 Release 存储之前\n"
"            // 也不会读取它。\n"
"            unsafe { (*slot.value.get()).write(value) };\n"
"            // Release：把写入的值发布给消费者。\n"
"            slot.sequence.store(pos.wrapping_add(1), Ordering::Release);\n"
"            return Ok(());\n"
"        }\n"
"        Err(current) => pos = current,\n"
"    }\n"
"} else if diff < 0 {\n"
"    return Err(value);\n"
"}"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:610
msgid ""
"Two conventions of the ring are types, not comments. On a full ring "
"``push`` returns ``Err(value)``, handing the record back so the caller "
"decides whether to count or drop it; a bare ``false`` would lose it. The "
"ring has a single consumer, and ``pop`` takes ``&mut self``, and shared "
"code must claim the unique ``Consumer`` first, so a second consumer does "
"not compile or is refused at run time."
msgstr ""
"这个环的两个约定是用类型而不是注释表达的。环满时，``push`` 返回 "
"``Err(value)``，把记录交还给调用方，由调用方决定计数还是丢弃；单纯返回 ``false`` "
"会让记录丢失。这个环只有一个消费者，``pop`` 接受 ``&mut self``，共享代码必须先取得唯一的 "
"``Consumer``，因此第二个消费者要么无法编译，要么在运行时被拒绝。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:612
msgid "Read-Copy-Update Engine Publication"
msgstr "读-复制-更新式的引擎发布"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:615
msgid ""
"The policy engine is rebuilt off the hot path when policies change. "
"Requests must never observe a half-built engine, and an engine must never "
"be freed while a request is still reading it. Sibuna publishes each "
"engine as an ``Arc<Engine>`` in an ``EngineSlot``, and each connection "
"reads it through an ``EngineCache``:"
msgstr ""
"策略变化时，策略引擎在热路径之外重建。请求绝不能看到构建了一半的引擎，引擎也绝不能在仍有请求读取它时被释放。Sibuna 把每个引擎作为 "
"``Arc<Engine>`` 发布到一个 ``EngineSlot`` 中，每个连接通过一个 ``EngineCache`` 读取它："

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:618
msgid ""
"The storage thread builds Engine v2 off the request path and publishes it "
"into the EngineSlot, which holds an RwLock around the current Arc and an "
"atomic generation. Connection thread A has refreshed: its cache holds "
"generation 2 and an Arc of Engine v2, and its next refresh is one acquire "
"load with no clone. Connection thread B still holds generation 1 and an "
"Arc of Engine v1; on its next refresh it sees the generation moved, takes "
"the read lock and clones the Arc of v2. Engine v1 is freed when B lets go "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"存储线程在请求路径之外构建 Engine v2，并把它发布到 EngineSlot 中；EngineSlot 持有一个包裹当前 Arc 的 "
"RwLock 和一个原子代次。连接线程 A 已经刷新：它的缓存持有代次 2 和指向 Engine v2 的 Arc，下一次刷新只需一次 "
"acquire 加载，无需克隆。连接线程 B 仍持有代次 1 和指向 Engine v1 的 "
"Arc；下次刷新时，它发现代次已变，于是获取读锁并克隆 v2 的 Arc。B 放手之后，Engine v1 即被释放。"

